#. The name of an action the player's cell can be told to do by one of its
#. "instincts" (a rule the player writes: "when <a sense reports something> ->
#. <do this>"), on a small chip. Lowercase, one or two short words. "rest"
#. means: stop moving on purpose and drift with the water.
#. entry: body.rest
#. Room: at most 112 px in 15 px type; the English takes 29 px.
#: game/normal/cell.gd
msgid "rest"
