#. A world's name until the player types one: a real place a microscopist
#. takes a water sample from ("pond water"). A "world" is one of the three the
#. player keeps: a drop of water and everything living in it. Short and
#. lowercase, as a player would name it; at most 20 characters, as a typed
#. name is. Shown in the top-right corner after the word "world", in 17 px
